de'i li 10 pi'e 04 pi'e 2009 la'o fy. tijlan .fy. cusku zoi skamyxatra.
> A lujvo for "motorcycle" would most likely be
> 
>  matryrelxilma'e
> 
> But it sometimes sounds too long for me to use around. So, as an
> experiment, I created a fu'ivla out of it:
> 
>  trxlma'e
...
> What do you think about it?
.skamyxatra

It's invalid.  As stated in section 4.7 of the CLL, the first rule of {fu'ivla}
requires that, if the consonant cluster is at the beginning of the word,
_every_ pair of adjacent consonants must be a valid initial consonant pair,
which "rx" and "lm" are not.

mu'omi'e .kamymecraijun.

